{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50707","headline":"偶登苏州重玄阁 · 张祜","name":"偶登苏州重玄阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞阁层层茂苑间，夏凉秋晚屙登攀。\n万家前後皆临水，四槛高低尽见山。\n何事越王侵敌国，不妨辽鹤唁人寰。\n五湖直下须归去，自笑身闲迹未闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}